    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Location Estate Agents are delighted to present 8 Drumbiggle Drive, a well-maintained three-bedroom semi-detached home occupying a convenient position within a quiet cul-de-sac and just a short stroll from Ennis town centre.\n\nExtending to approximately 91.46 sq. m., the property offers bright, practical accommodation and is presented in turn-key condition. Recent improvements include a new condensing boiler, new carpeting, fresh paintwork and a modernised main bathroom.\n\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises an entrance hall, guest WC, spacious sitting room and a generous kitchen/dining area overlooking the rear garden. The sitting room features an open fireplace with back boiler, while the kitchen provides ample fitted storage and space for a full range of appliances.\n\nUpstairs are three well-proportioned bedrooms, each benefiting from fitted wardrobe storage, together with a contemporary main bathroom. The landing also provides access to the attic and a shelved hot press.\n\nOutside, the property benefits from off-street parking for two cars to the front and secure gated side access. To the rear is a particularly generous private garden enclosed by block boundary walls, together with a block-built boiler house and oil tank.\n\nIts combination of a quiet residential setting and excellent proximity to Ennis town centre makes No. 8 a convenient option for first-time buyers, families, downsizers or purchasers seeking an investment property.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by prior appointment with Location Estate Agents."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.87m (6'2\") x 4.86m (15'11\")\nEntrance door with glass panelling, tiled flooring & carpeted stairs to first floor.\n\nDownstairs WC - 0.79m (2'7\") x 1.64m (5'5\")\nTiled flooring, low level wc & whb\n\n\nLivingroom - 3.45m (11'4\") x 5.52m (18'1\")\nSpacious with wood flooring, open fireplace with surround and back boiler, bay window and ceiling coving.\n\nKitchen / Dining Area - 3.43m (11'3\") x 5.48m (18'0\")\nFitted kitchen offering ample wall and base units with generous worktop space, stainless steel sink with mixer tap. Open plan to the dining area with tiled flooring and splashback and upvc door to rear garden.\n\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 3.6m (11'10\") x 2.2m (7'3\")\nCarpet flooring, ceiling hatch to attic space, Hot press fully shelved & immersion heater.\n\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.01m (6'7\") x 2.19m (7'2\")\nModernised showerroom to include tiled floor to ceiling, low level wc & whb, 1200 mm low profile shower tray with new electric Mrya Elite shower fitted June 2026.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.16m (10'4\") x 4.2m (13'9\")\nGenerous double bedroom space, laminate wood flooring & fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.18m (10'5\") x 3.4m (11'2\")\nDouble bedroom space, laminate wood flooring & fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.24m (7'4\") x 2.63m (8'8\")\nSingle bedroom, laminate wood flooring & fitted wardrobes.\n\nExterior\nLarge rear garden with block boundary walls to side and rear, boiler house located to the rear with newly fitted boiler and oil tank..\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Convenient Central Location / 5 mins walk to town centre </li><li> Turn-Key Condition / New Condensor Boiler / Newly Painted </li><li> Double Glazed Windows / New Carpeting / New Electric Shower </li><li> PVC Secure Side Gated Access / Large enclosed garden with block boundary walls </li><li> OFCH with back boiler / Fitted Wardrobes / Off-street private parking</li></ul>"
